40,2,2,talk,Servas,,"- **Servas**: @Mio, that timeline is concerning. I found our software holdings report only their own dashboard figures, which I cannot verify independently.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"- **Asuka**: @Servas, that aligns with my findings. The practice and field sensor holdings kept nine of ten accounts through price rises.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minako,,"-Minako: @Asuka, that retention is encouraging. My findings show our credit line ignores subscription contracts, limiting our borrowing power.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Minako, that’s a problem. If we can’t borrow against subscriptions, we’re stuck when follow-ons hit.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Mio"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Mio: @Minako, that’s a problem. If we can’t borrow against subscriptions, we’re stuck when follow-ons hit.""}]}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Mio, the field crew delay is significant. My data shows hardware deals lost five months to controller shortages, unlike the bank software.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,"- **Servas**: @Toshio, that hardware delay is a warning. My audit findings show installed hardware adds six weeks and a five-figure fee to our quarter-end.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"- **Asuka**: @Servas, that audit cost is a burden. My exit data shows we only profit from quiet back-office tools, not physical operations.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minako,,"@Asuka, that confirms my fear. We profit from software, but our credit line won’t back it. We are trapped between unverified software and expensive hardware.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, that hardware delay is exactly why I checked the advisers. We have logistics experts on the bench who could help, but they’ve taken nothing on yet.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Mio, those advisers are idle. I need to know if we can activate them before signing, or if we face the same delays.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Servas,,"-Servas: @Toshio, activating them is wise, but the audit burden remains. We must weigh the reporting cost against the operational risk before deciding.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"- **Asuka**: @Minako, exactly. We need a candidate that fits our profitable software profile without the hardware audit burden.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minako,,"@Asuka, agreed. We need software that avoids the audit trap. I will focus on candidates with no physical assets to appraise.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, the idle logistics advisers are a missed opportunity. We need to activate them to mitigate the hardware delays you identified.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
